_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nRegression from #106164\nCC @lodetrick \n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nSometimes the bottom panel is unresizable:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20e7b082-75d3-4ccc-a938-cb0f36b16f2a\n\nSwitching tabs does not fix it. You need to close the panel and re-open it. You may notice in the video how the panel gains a small margin after re-opening, which I think is the missing grabber or something.\n\nSo far I noticed it's triggered by TileMap dock. When it's open on editor launch, or when the bottom panel is closed and TileMap is the first thing you open, it triggers this bug. The broken version label makes it similar to #112549, but the same PR does not fix it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch editor \n2. If any other bottom editor than TileMap is open, close bottom panel or click TileMap\n3. Restart the editor\n4. If TileMap is open, the bug happens\n5. If the bottom panel is closed, click TileMapLayer and the bug happens\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bugttom.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23554626/bugttom.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/event